It has [[cosmopolitan distribution]].<ref name="GBIF">{{cite web |title=Lepidozia reptans (L.) Dumort. |url=https://www.gbif.org/species/2689102 |website=www.gbif.org |access-date=5 February 2021 |language=en}}</ref>

